  m_Name: Documentation
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _markdownContent: '# Zombie Survivor


    A Vampire Survivors style auto-shooter.


    {height=300}![screenshot](Packages/com.hutonggames.playmaker/Editor/Addons/Packages/com.hutonggames.playmaker.samples.zombie-survivor.jpg)


    ##
    Features


    - Infinite generated map using terrain chunks.

    - Endless
    enemy waves with difficulty scaling over time.

    - Multiple weapons with level
    ups.

    - Shields that push enemies away.

    - Enemy damage number popups.

    -
    Player health and XP bars.

    - Object pools for enemies, projectiles, fx,
    etc.'
